  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Circuitry — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have mastered your technique allowing you to expand your domain. Within your domain, you are always under the effect of your <em>Circuit</em>. At initiative 20, creatures of your choice within your domain take necrotic damage equal to their current cursed energy as your domain saps their cursed energy into the circuit.</p>",
